From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] pingcheck: validate dual-stack requests and close failed sockets

Use address-family-specific ICMP and TCP sockets, resolve into sockaddr_storage,
and require the current request cookie, sequence, sender and payload. Track
active sockets and outstanding replies explicitly, including descriptor zero.
The legacy configuration continues to select IPv4 until the schema patch.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>

